  "title": "Cold Start",
  "playerBriefing": "A solar surge has stranded research station Orison on emergency power. Kite and Wren have eighteen turns before the archive bulkhead seals. Restore auxiliary power, activate both archive consoles together, recover the flight recorder, and extract both units through Landing Bay. A security drone patrols the station, and radiation has contaminated at least one service link.",
